<title>USA: Power Control value support rights approved.</title>
<headline>Power Control value support rights approved.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power Control Technologies Inc said Thursday a registration statement covering the value support rights issued by Mafco Consolidated Group Inc has been declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>As a result, the company said, it is anticipated that the New York Stock Exchange will begin trading in the value support rights on December 27 under the symbol, MFOrt.N.</p>
<p>The value support rights certificates are to be mailed on December 30 to Power Control stockholders of record on December 23.</p>
<p>Power Control produces licorice extract.</p>
</text>
